sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Angular(Client)
    participant AccountService(Angular)
    participant API(AccountController)
    participant Identity(SignInManager)
    participant Database(StoreContext)
@startuml ECommerceFlows
actor User
participant "Angular Client" as Angular
participant "AccountService" as AccountService
participant "API (AccountController)" as API
participant "Identity (SignInManager)" as Identity
participant "Database (StoreContext)" as Database

'--- Registration & Login ---
User -> Angular: Fill registration form
Angular -> AccountService: register(values)
AccountService -> API: POST /api/account/register
API -> Identity: CreateAsync(user, password)
Identity -> Database: Save new user
Database --> Identity: Success/Failure
Identity --> API: Result
API --> AccountService: Registration response
AccountService --> Angular: Show success/error

User -> Angular: Fill login form
Angular -> AccountService: login(values)
AccountService -> API: POST /api/account/login
API -> Identity: Authenticate user
Identity -> Database: Validate credentials
Database --> Identity: Success/Failure
Identity --> API: Result
API --> AccountService: Login response (user info)
AccountService --> Angular: Set currentUser, redirect

'--- Cart Flow ---
participant "CartService" as CartService
participant "API (CartController)" as CartAPI

User -> Angular: Add product to cart
Angular -> CartService: addToCart(product)
CartService -> CartAPI: POST /api/cart/add
CartAPI -> Database: Update cart items
Database --> CartAPI: Success/Failure
CartAPI --> CartService: Cart update response
CartService --> Angular: Update cart UI

User -> Angular: View cart
Angular -> CartService: getCart()
CartService -> CartAPI: GET /api/cart
CartAPI -> Database: Fetch cart items
Database --> CartAPI: Cart data
CartAPI --> CartService: Cart data
CartService --> Angular: Show cart

'--- Orders Flow ---
participant "OrderService" as OrderService
participant "API (OrdersController)" as OrdersAPI

User -> Angular: Place order
Angular -> OrderService: placeOrder(orderDetails)
OrderService -> OrdersAPI: POST /api/orders
OrdersAPI -> Database: Create order
Database --> OrdersAPI: Order confirmation
OrdersAPI --> OrderService: Order response
OrderService --> Angular: Show order confirmation

User -> Angular: View orders
Angular -> OrderService: getOrders()
OrderService -> OrdersAPI: GET /api/orders
OrdersAPI -> Database: Fetch orders
Database --> OrdersAPI: Orders data
OrdersAPI --> OrderService: Orders data
OrderService --> Angular: Show orders

'--- Checkout Flow ---
participant "PaymentService" as PaymentService
participant "API (PaymentsController)" as PaymentsAPI

User -> Angular: Checkout
Angular -> PaymentService: checkout(paymentInfo)
PaymentService -> PaymentsAPI: POST /api/payments/checkout
PaymentsAPI -> Database: Process payment, update order status
Database --> PaymentsAPI: Payment result
PaymentsAPI --> PaymentService: Payment response
PaymentService --> Angular: Show payment status
@enduml
    User->>Angular(Client): Fill registration form
    Angular(Client)->>AccountService(Angular): register(values)
    AccountService(Angular)->>API(AccountController): POST /api/account/register
    API(AccountController)->>Identity(SignInManager): CreateAsync(user, password)
    Identity(SignInManager)->>Database(StoreContext): Save new user
    Database(StoreContext)-->>Identity(SignInManager): Success/Failure
    Identity(SignInManager)-->>API(AccountController): Result
    API(AccountController)-->>AccountService(Angular): Registration response
    AccountService(Angular)-->>Angular(Client): Show success/error

    User->>Angular(Client): Fill login form
    Angular(Client)->>AccountService(Angular): login(values)
    AccountService(Angular)->>API(AccountController): POST /api/account/login
    API(AccountController)->>Identity(SignInManager): Authenticate user
    Identity(SignInManager)->>Database(StoreContext): Validate credentials
    Database(StoreContext)-->>Identity(SignInManager): Success/Failure
    Identity(SignInManager)-->>API(AccountController): Result
    API(AccountController)-->>AccountService(Angular): Login response (user info)
    AccountService(Angular)-->>Angular(Client): Set currentUser, redirect